# Terraform runtime and state files
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Sensitive SSH private keys generated by Terraform
ansible/id_rsa*
*.pem

# Dynamic Ansible inventory (keep template / example only)
ansible/inventory/hosts.ini
ansible/*.retry

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
